tools.description:
[designcraft] Insert Endnote
Location: Type
Params doc: {text?} — a reference at the insertion point; the first one makes the endnote frame on a new last page → {story, id, frame}

[designcraft] New Note
Location: Type › Notes
Params doc: {text, author?} — at the insertion point → {story, id}

[designcraft] Delete Note
Location: Type › Notes
Params doc: {story, id}

[designcraft] Close Path
Location: Object › Paths
Params doc: {id}

[designcraft] New Article
Location: Window › Articles
Params doc: {name?, ids? (default: the selection)} → {name}

[designcraft] Track Changes
Location: Type › Track Changes
Params doc: {on?: bool (default: toggle)}

[designcraft] New Condition…
Location: Window › Type & Tables › Conditional Text
Params doc: {name, color?: [r, g, b], visible?} → {name}

[designcraft] Define Lists…
Location: Type › Bulleted and Numbered Lists
Params doc: {name, continueAcrossStories?: true, rename?} — paragraphs join it with type.para {listType: numbers, listName}

[designcraft] Place and Link
Location: Edit
Params doc: {story (parent), rect, spread?} — a new frame whose story copies the parent and stays linked → {id, story}

[designcraft] Liquid Page Rule
Location: Layout › Liquid Layout
Params doc: {rule: off|scale|reCenter|guideBased|objectBased, pages?: [1-based] (default: all)}

[designcraft] New Tag
Location: Window › Utilities › Tags
Params doc: {name, color?: [r, g, b]}

[designcraft] Load DTD…
Location: Window › Utilities › Tags
Params doc: {path | text} — keep the DTD for validation and add a tag for each declared element; the root takes the first element's name unless already named → {elements}

[designcraft] Import XML…
Location: File
Params doc: {path | text} — each element's content goes into the next text frame with that tag (child elements of mapped tags become paragraphs in their style) → {placed, unmatched}

[designcraft] New Stroke Style…
Location: Object › Stroke Styles
Params doc: {name, type: stripes|dash|dot, bands?: [[start, width] (fractions of the weight)], pattern?: [dash, gap, …] (pt)} — apply with object.stroke {type: {kind: "style", name}}

[designcraft] Type on a Path Options…
Location: Type › Type on a Path
Params doc: {id?, start?, flip?, align?: baseline|ascender|descender|center, delete?: true (Delete Type from Path)}

[designcraft] Generate QR Code…
Location: Object
Params doc: {type?: url|text|sms|email|vcard (default url), content (url/text), number?, message?, to?, subject?, body?, name?, phone?, email?, org?, url?, color? (swatch, [Black]), rect? (new object; else into the selected frame, or re-encode a selected code), spread?} → {id, content}

[designcraft] Package…
Location: File
Params doc: {dir: folder to create, idml?: true, pdf?: false, instructions?: text} — the document (its placed files relinked to Links/), Links/, the font files that draw its text in Document Fonts/ (fallback fonts included; unless their licence restricts it), an IDML copy, an optional PDF and a report → {dir, files, report}

[designcraft] Insert Row Above
Location: Table › Insert
Params doc: {count?}

[designcraft] Insert Row Below
Location: Table › Insert
Params doc: {count?}

[designcraft] Insert Column Left
Location: Table › Insert
Params doc: {count?}

[designcraft] Insert Column Right
Location: Table › Insert
Params doc: {count?}

[designcraft] Delete Table
Location: Table › Delete
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Unmerge Cells
Location: Table
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Distribute Columns Evenly
Location: Table
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Select Table
Location: Table › Select
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Select Row
Location: Table › Select
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Select Column
Location: Table › Select
Params doc: {}

[designcraft] Delete Pages
Location: Layout › Pages
Params doc: {pages: [index]}

[designcraft] Move Pages…
Location: Layout › Pages
Params doc: {from, to}

[designcraft] Duplicate Spread
Location: Layout › Pages
Params doc: {spread}

[designcraft] Apply Parent to Pages…
Location: Layout › Pages
Params doc: {pages: [index], parent: "A"|null}

[designcraft] New Parent…
Location: Layout › Pages
Params doc: {prefix?, name?: "Parent"}

[designcraft] Margins and Columns…
Location: Layout
Params doc: {pages?: [index] (default all), margins?: number|{top,bottom,inside,outside}, columns?, gutter?, adjustLayout?: bool (objects follow the margins)}

[designcraft] Numbering & Section Options…
Location: Layout
Params doc: {page (1-based; starts a section there), startNumber?: n|null (continue), style?: arabic|upperRoman|lowerRoman|upperLetters|lowerLetters, prefix?, includePrefix?, marker?, remove?: bool}

[designcraft] Change All
Location: Edit › Find/Change
Params doc: {find, change, grep?, caseSensitive?, wholeWord?, scope?, story?, first?: bool (change only the first match), attrs?: {character attributes applied to changed text}} → {count}

[designcraft] Table of Contents…
Location: Layout
Params doc: {entries: [{style, level?: 1}] | styles: [names], title?: "Contents", pageNumbers?: true, page?: 1-based page for a new frame (its margins), rect?: [x0,y0,x1,y1] (spread coords)} → {story, entries}

[designcraft] Generate Index…
Location: Layout › Index
Params doc: {title?: "Index", sectionHeadings?: true, runIn?: false, page?: 1-based page for a new frame, rect?: [x0,y0,x1,y1]} — replaces the existing index → {story, entries}

[designcraft] Anchored Object Options…
Location: Object › Anchored Object
Params doc: {story?, index? (default: the object at the insertion point), position?: inline|aboveLine|custom, yOffset?, align?: left|center|right, spaceBefore?, spaceAfter?, xRelative?/yRelative?: anchor|textFrame|columnEdge|pageMargin|pageEdge, xOffset?, objectPoint?/refPoint?: 0..8, keepWithinColumn?}

[designcraft] Delete All Guides on Spread
Location: View › Grids & Guides
Params doc: {spread?}

[designcraft] Create Guides…
Location: Layout
Params doc: {rows?: 0, columns?: 0, rowGutter?: 12, columnGutter?: 12, fitTo?: margins|page, removeExisting?: false, spread?, page? (index in the spread; default all pages)}

[designcraft] Relink to Folder…
Location: Window › Links
Params doc: {dir?: folder to look in (default: each link's own folder), extension?: e.g. "tif" (Relink File Extension), assets?: [ids], missingOnly?: bool (default true with `dir`)} → {relinked, notFound: [names]}

[designcraft] Add Hyphenation Exception
Location: Edit › Spelling › User Dictionary
Params doc: {word: "ex~am~ple" (breaks only at ~) or a word with no ~ (never hyphenated)}

[designcraft] Add to Dictionary
Location: Edit › Spelling
Params doc: {word}
